  annotation "note_1771589965254_1", anchor: "two families — Moqai and Xuelin", text: "My Snowdrift-numb annotation names them Ouheng and Meisou, following the administrative ice. This entry follows the liturgical record: Moqai and Xuelin. Two source traditions, two sets of names for the same seven penguins. I should have caught the discrepancy before committing both to print.", type: :correction, display: :popout
